@startuml UC-01-Login
title Sequence Diagram: Login

actor "Users/Admin" as User
participant "Halaman Login\n(React)" as UI
participant "POST /api/auth/login" as API
participant "AuthController" as Controller
participant "AuthService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL\n(tabel Akun)" as DB
participant "Google Auth" as Google

== Flow Normal - Login Manual ==

User -> UI: Membuka halaman login
activate UI
UI --> User: Menampilkan form login
User -> UI: Memasukkan email & password\ndan klik "Login"
UI -> API: POST kredensial
activate API
API -> Controller: login()
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: validateCredentials(email, password)
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM Akun\nWHERE email = '[email]'
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return data akun\n(password hash, statusAktif)
deactivate DB

alt Akun ditemukan & statusAktif = true
    Service -> Service: Verify password hash\n(bcrypt.compare)
    
    alt Password cocok
        Service -> Service: Generate JWT token
        Service --> Controller: { success: true, token, user }
        Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
        API --> UI: Response sukses
        UI -> UI: Simpan token ke localStorage
        UI --> User: Redirect ke Home
    else Password tidak cocok
        Service --> Controller: { success: false,\nerror: "Email atau password salah" }
        Controller --> API: Response 401 Unauthorized
        API --> UI: Error response
        UI --> User: Tampilkan alert error
    end
    
else Akun tidak ditemukan OR statusAktif = false
    Service --> Controller: { success: false,\nerror: "Akun tidak aktif" }
    Controller --> API: Response 403 Forbidden
    API --> UI: Error response
    UI --> User: Tampilkan alert error
end

deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
deactivate UI

== Flow Alternatif - Login via Google Auth ==

User -> UI: Klik "Login via Google"
activate UI
UI -> Google: Redirect ke Google Auth
activate Google
Google --> User: Halaman login Google
User -> Google: Masukkan kredensial Google
Google --> UI: Return token & data profil
deactivate Google

UI -> API: POST /api/auth/google-login\ndengan token
activate API
API -> Controller: googleLogin()
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: verifyGoogleToken(token)
activate Service
Service -> Service: Verify token & ekstrak email
Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM Akun\nWHERE email = '[google_email]'
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return data akun (jika ada)
deactivate DB

alt Akun terdaftar
    Service -> Service: Generate JWT token
    Service --> Controller: { success: true, token, user }
    Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
    API --> UI: Response sukses
    UI -> UI: Simpan token ke localStorage
    UI --> User: Redirect ke Home
else Akun tidak terdaftar
    Service --> Controller: { success: false,\nerror: "Akun belum terdaftar" }
    Controller --> API: Response 404 Not Found
    API --> UI: Error response
    UI --> User: Tampilkan pesan\n"Silakan register terlebih dahulu"
end

deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
deactivate UI

== Exceptional Flow - Database Error ==

note over DB
  Jika terjadi database error,
  sistem akan rollback dan
  menampilkan error message
  ke user
end note

@enduml
